title: Preferable
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Futures we want. What should happen, as opposed to what could.

The other bands of [[The Futures Cone]] are about likelihood. This one is about values, so it can sit anywhere in the cone, from the [[Probable]] to the [[Preposterous]].

Whose preference? That is the question to ask of it.

See [[020261006210432 Entry - Preferable Futures]], [[Sustainability]], [[Dunne and Raby]]
